      "created": 1791454521,
      "updated": 1793876048
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec608400000000000b6c18",
      "text": " 正式名称：[とある魔術の禁書目録外伝 とある科学の超電磁砲]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793876101,
      "updated": 1793876142
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec604800000000000b6c15",
      "text": "\t原作（[マンガ]）は[2026/10/27]に完結",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1793876041,
      "updated": 1793876146
    },
    {
      "id": "6aec60d300000000000b6c1a",
      "text": "\t\t全21巻",
